OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys in court over Halloween
OL,4,Aparty stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys have appeared in court after
OL,7,Ffive teenagers were stabbed at a
OL,8,FHalloween party in Hampshire.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a home in Park
OL,11,FRoad, Chandler's Ford, shortly after
OL,12,F22:30 GMT on Saturday, after an
OL,13,F"unknown group" got into the party over
OL,14,Fa garden fence.
OL,16,FTwo 16-year-old boys from Southampton
OL,17,Fappeared at Southampton Youth Court,
OL,18,Fone charged with attempted murder and
OL,19,Fthe other with wounding with intent.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
